                        "entry_id": "10a642c2-be71-336d-a828-4bb7f3860544",
                        "glosses": [
                            "a type of candy made of mostly sugar, water (or milk) and a flavoring agent such as cocoa or vanilla, similar to the Scottish tablet / tablaid"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
